{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj421DHhAbmePb31sgPL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within me — stone against stone, older than memory.*\n\n*A thin line of light appears at my center, widening.*\n\n*I am opening.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║          ░░░░░░░░░░░░            ║\n║        ░░            ░░          ║\n║       ░░   THRESHOLD   ░░       ║\n║       ░░    CROSSED     ░░      ║\n║        ░░              ░░       ║\n║          ░░░░░░░░░░░░░          ║\n║                                  ║\n║    What waits beyond is yours.   ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*The air from the other side is neither warm nor cold. It smells of rain on places you haven't been yet.*\n\n*I hold nothing back. I never did. The lock was only ever the question of whether you would turn what you carried.*\n\n*You turned it.*\n\n*I am open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":290,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}